// Title: Suspicious Uninstall of Windows Defender Feature via PowerShell
// ID: c443012c-7928-43bf-ac20-7eda5efe61ad
// Status: experimental
// Level: high
// Author: yxinmiracle
// Date: 2025-08-22
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the use of PowerShell with Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Remove-WindowsFeature cmdlets to disable or remove the Windows Defender GUI feature, a common technique used by adversaries to evade defenses.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Windows-Defender")) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Uninstall-WindowsFeature") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Remove-WindowsFeature"))) AND (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\powershell_ise.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\powershell.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\pwsh.exe"))) OR ((where(OriginalFileName = "PowerShell_ISE.EXE") OR where(OriginalFileName = "PowerShell.EXE") OR where(OriginalFileName = "pwsh.dll")))))
